    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え！？\r\nそれは俺の台詞だろ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずっとかなの好みを教えてもらってたわけだし──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そうは言ったって、こっちの買い物に付き合わせたんだもの\r\nお礼くらい言わせてよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そうじゃなきゃ、私があなたのこと\r\n便利な荷物持ちって思ってるみたいじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……そうか\r\nじゃあ、うん。どういたしまして",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それから俺もありがとう\r\n今日は勉強になったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……どういたしまして",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……ま、これできっとこのあと\r\n稽古場に素敵な差し入れをくださるんでしょうから？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110060,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "こっちもより一層気合いを入れて、頑張らなくちゃねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、任された！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2700
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
