    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "うちにはインフルエンサーかつ\r\nセルフプロデュースのプロがついてるしね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110100,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "MEMちょさまさまだわ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんMEMちょの力も大きいよ。でも、\r\nかなだって実際に出演して、動画を盛り上げてるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうやってコツコツ積み上げてきた努力が\r\n今回の舞台みたいな大きな仕事に繋がって──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "多くの人がかなの魅力に気づくきっかけになったんだって、\r\n俺は思ったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110110,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "お世辞ならいらないってば\r\n自分がこけやすいのなんて自分が一番よく知ってるんだから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……本気で言ってるんだからな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110120,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "あらそう？\r\nまぁでもプロデューサーがそう思うのも無理はないわよね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110130,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "私くらい演技ができる高校生なんてそういないし、\r\n現場での気遣いだって完璧で使いやすいし",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110140,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "それに──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、頑張り屋さんでストイックで\r\n自分の仕事に対してどこまでも真摯だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110150,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
