    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110180,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……変な人だって忘れてたわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110190,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "臆面もなく、アイドルやってる今の私を\r\n推してるとか言っちゃう人だった",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは別に変な人じゃないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "かなは立派なアイドルで\r\nたくさんの誰かの推しなんだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110200,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "はいはいわかったわかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110210,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "認めないと延々このいたたまれない褒め言葉が\r\n続くんでしょう？　勘弁してほしいわ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110220,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "今のままで立派だなんて思えないのよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200511/2802005110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005110230,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "──あなたの推しは、\r\nもっと上を目指してるアイドルなんだからね",
